                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A very simplistic wave shooter with okay game mechanics. \nGraphics are from aweful to at least a bit pretty.\nGun-handling is alright. Enemies are kind of ugly. \n\nOverall I had fun playing it. Would I play it again after first test session? I don't think so.\nI can not recommend the game for full price - I know it is only 3 EUR -, but let's be honest this will be a one play game for you too. So just wait for a sail and buy it for 1 or 1,5 EUR.\n\nInsofar I recommend the game on sale.\n\n[i] Twitch Channel : https://www.twitch.tv/mrorange55\nYoutube Channel : https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1UE5TPoF0HX0HVpF_E4uPQ/videos?view_as=subscriber [/i]",
